        <title>eShop</title>
        <link>https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/en/p/eshop/</link>
        <pubDate>Fri, 02 May 2025 15:30:32 +0800</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/en/p/eshop/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593945049362-068f62683e56?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3NDYxNzA4Njl8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.0.3" alt="Featured image of post eShop" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;dotneteshop&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/dotnet/eShop&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;dotnet/eShop&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;eshop-reference-application---adventureworks&#34;&gt;eShop Reference Application - &amp;ldquo;AdventureWorks&amp;rdquo;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;A reference .NET application implementing an e-commerce website using a services-based architecture using &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/aspire/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;.NET Aspire&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/img/eshop_architecture.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;eShop Reference Application architecture diagram&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/img/eshop_homepage.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;eShop homepage screenshot&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;getting-started&#34;&gt;Getting Started
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This version of eShop is based on .NET 9.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous eShop versions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/dotnet/eShop/tree/release/8.0&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;.NET 8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;prerequisites&#34;&gt;Prerequisites
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clone the eShop repository: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/dotnet/eshop&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://github.com/dotnet/eshop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Install &amp;amp; start Docker Desktop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;windows-with-visual-studio&#34;&gt;Windows with Visual Studio
&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/vs/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Visual Studio 2022 version 17.10 or newer&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select the following workloads:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ASP.NET and web development&lt;/code&gt; workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;.NET Aspire SDK&lt;/code&gt; component in &lt;code&gt;Individual components&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optional: &lt;code&gt;.NET Multi-platform App UI development&lt;/code&gt; to run client apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Or&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the following commands in a Powershell &amp;amp; Terminal running as &lt;code&gt;Administrator&lt;/code&gt; to automatically configure your environment with the required tools to build and run this application. (Note: A restart is required and included in the script below.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-powershell&#34; data-lang=&#34;powershell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;install-Module&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-Name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;Microsoft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;WinGet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;Configuration&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-AllowPrerelease&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-AcceptLicense&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-Force&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;$env:Path&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;no&#34;&gt;System.Environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;]::&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;GetEnvironmentVariable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Path&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Machine&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;no&#34;&gt;System.Environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;]::&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;GetEnvironmentVariable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Path&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;User&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;get-WinGetConfiguration&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-file&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.\.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;configurations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;\&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;vside&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;dsc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;yaml&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;Invoke-WinGetConfiguration&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-AcceptConfigurationAgreements&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;From Dev Home go to &lt;code&gt;Machine Configuration -&amp;gt; Clone repositories&lt;/code&gt;. Enter the URL for this repository. In the confirmation screen look for the section &lt;code&gt;Configuration File Detected&lt;/code&gt; and click &lt;code&gt;Run File&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;mac-linux--windows-without-visual-studio&#34;&gt;Mac, Linux, &amp;amp; Windows without Visual Studio
&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install the latest &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://dot.net/download?cid=eshop&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;.NET 9 SDK&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Or&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the following commands in a Powershell &amp;amp; Terminal running as &lt;code&gt;Administrator&lt;/code&gt; to automatically configuration your environment with the required tools to build and run this application. (Note: A restart is required after running the script below.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5 id=&#34;install-visual-studio-code-and-related-extensions&#34;&gt;Install Visual Studio Code and related extensions
&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-powershell&#34; data-lang=&#34;powershell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;install-Module&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-Name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;Microsoft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;WinGet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;Configuration&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-AllowPrerelease&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-AcceptLicense&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-Force&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;$env:Path&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;no&#34;&gt;System.Environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;]::&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;GetEnvironmentVariable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Path&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Machine&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;+&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;no&#34;&gt;System.Environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;]::&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;GetEnvironmentVariable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Path&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;User&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;get-WinGetConfiguration&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;-file&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.\.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;configurations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;\&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;vscode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;dsc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;yaml&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;Invoke-WinGetConfiguration&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-AcceptConfigurationAgreements&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: These commands may require &lt;code&gt;sudo&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optional: Install &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/csharp/get-started&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Visual Studio Code with C# Dev Kit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optional: Install &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/maui/get-started/installation?tabs=visual-studio-code&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;.NET MAUI Workload&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note: When running on Mac with Apple Silicon (M series processor), Rosetta 2 for grpc-tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;running-the-solution&#34;&gt;Running the solution
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!WARNING]
Remember to ensure that Docker is started&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Windows only) Run the application from Visual Studio:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open the &lt;code&gt;eShop.Web.slnf&lt;/code&gt; file in Visual Studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that &lt;code&gt;eShop.AppHost.csproj&lt;/code&gt; is your startup project&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hit Ctrl-F5 to launch Aspire&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Or run the application from your terminal:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-powershell&#34; data-lang=&#34;powershell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;dotnet&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;run&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-project&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;src&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;eShop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;AppHost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;eShop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;AppHost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;csproj&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;then look for lines like this in the console output in order to find the URL to open the Aspire dashboard:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Login to the dashboard at: http://localhost:19888/login?t&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;uniquelogincodeforyou
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may need to install ASP.NET Core HTTPS development certificates first, and then close all browser tabs. Learn more at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://aka.ms/aspnet/https-trust-dev-cert&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://aka.ms/aspnet/https-trust-dev-cert&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;azure-open-ai&#34;&gt;Azure Open AI
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;When using Azure OpenAI, inside &lt;em&gt;eShop.AppHost/appsettings.json&lt;/em&gt;, add the following section:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-json&#34; data-lang=&#34;json&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;ConnectionStrings&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;nt&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;OpenAi&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Endpoint=xxx;Key=xxx;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;  &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Replace the values with your own. Then, in the eShop.AppHost &lt;em&gt;Program.cs&lt;/em&gt;, set this value to &lt;strong&gt;true&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-csharp&#34; data-lang=&#34;csharp&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kt&#34;&gt;bool&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;useOpenAI&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kc&#34;&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Here&amp;rsquo;s additional guidance on the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/aspire/azureai/azureai-openai-component?tabs=dotnet-cli&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;.NET Aspire OpenAI component&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;use-azure-developer-cli&#34;&gt;Use Azure Developer CLI
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can use the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://aka.ms/azd&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Azure Developer CLI&lt;/a&gt; to run this project on Azure with only a few commands. Follow the next instructions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install the latest or update to the latest &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://aka.ms/azure-dev/install&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Azure Developer CLI (azd)&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Log in &lt;code&gt;azd&lt;/code&gt; (if you haven&amp;rsquo;t done it before) to your Azure account:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;azd auth login
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initialize &lt;code&gt;azd&lt;/code&gt; from the root of the repo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;azd init
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During init:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select &lt;code&gt;Use code in the current directory&lt;/code&gt;. Azd will automatically detect the .NET Aspire project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confirm &lt;code&gt;.NET (Aspire)&lt;/code&gt; and continue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select which services to expose to the Internet (exposing &lt;code&gt;webapp&lt;/code&gt; is enough to test the sample).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finalize the initialization by giving a name to your environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Create Azure resources and deploy the sample by running:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;azd up
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Notes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The operation takes a few minutes the first time it is ever run for an environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At the end of the process, &lt;code&gt;azd&lt;/code&gt; will display the &lt;code&gt;url&lt;/code&gt; for the webapp. Follow that link to test the sample.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can run &lt;code&gt;azd up&lt;/code&gt; after saving changes to the sample to re-deploy and update the sample.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report any issues to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/Azure/azure-dev/issues&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;azure-dev&lt;/a&gt; repo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/developer/azure-developer-cli/troubleshoot?tabs=Browser&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;FAQ and troubleshoot&lt;/a&gt; for azd.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;contributing&#34;&gt;Contributing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For more information on contributing to this repo, read &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./CONTRIBUTING.md&#34; &gt;the contribution documentation&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;CODE-OF-CONDUCT.md&#34; &gt;the Code of Conduct&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;sample-data&#34;&gt;Sample data
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The sample catalog data is defined in &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/dotnet/eShop/blob/main/src/Catalog.API/Setup/catalog.json&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;catalog.json&lt;/a&gt;. Those product names, descriptions, and brand names are fictional and were generated using &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/ai-services/openai/how-to/chatgpt&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;GPT-35-Turbo&lt;/a&gt;, and the corresponding &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/dotnet/eShop/tree/main/src/Catalog.API/Pics&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;product images&lt;/a&gt; were generated using &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://openai.com/dall-e-3&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;DALL·E 3&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;eshop-on-azure&#34;&gt;eShop on Azure
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;For a version of this app configured for deployment on Azure, please view &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/Azure-Samples/eShopOnAzure&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;the eShop on Azure&lt;/a&gt; repo.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
        </item>
        
